{"id":"n84130-1-10","stage":4,"title":"한데 · 一起","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84130-1-10-1","ko":"이 시장에 꽃을 파는 가게가 있나요?","zh":"这个市场里有卖花的店吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"시장에","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시장에","audio":"/audio/f6fa1597901d4733fb6a.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃을","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃을","audio":"/audio/f2e431e87f02267d34e6.mp3"}},{"text":"파는","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파는","audio":"/audio/25c21fc22e6f2547eb25.mp3"}},{"text":"가게가","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게가","audio":"/audio/d93ad8ca691832ed80c0.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d61a37300c796d5f2a22.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84130-1-10-2","ko":"꽃집들은 저쪽에 한데 몰려 있어요.","zh":"花店都集中在那边呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"꽃집들은","meaning":"花店","explanation":"꽃집：花店；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"꽃집","audio":"/audio/2eef418b0fc1a0618300.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38277","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃집들은","audio":"/audio/df75fe9f4215bfec3e0c.mp3"}},{"text":"저쪽에","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저쪽：那边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저쪽","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75761","senseId":"1","lemma":"저쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저쪽에","audio":"/audio/0056568e730234185be4.mp3"}},{"text":"한데","meaning":"一起，一处","explanation":"한데：一起，一处。","readi